          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: Two witnesses observed on March 15, 2008, from 10:20 PM to 10:30 PM, three successive silent passages of a glowing phenomenon described as a \"ball of fire.\" The witness description (shimmering ball), the spacing between observations, the movement consistent with the dominant wind direction (from the East), the time and day of the week (Saturday evening) are consistent with the observation of Thai lanterns. This case is classified \"B\": probable observation of 3 Thai lanterns.",
